  m_text: '<b>Curator''s Vanity</b><br>

    Rianna Walcott<br>

    <i>Video Installation</i><br><br>

    This
    video installation introduces the vision behind the Black Homeplaces XR exhibition.
    Through reflections on memory, identity, and care, it invites visitors to consider
    how everyday rituals and personal objects shape the meaning of homeplace.'
