  m_text: '<b>Housing Co-op Archive Map</b>


    Jessica A. Rucker, Linda Leaks,
    Ajowa Ifateyo, and Elizabeth Tibebu


    <i>Interactive Archive</i>


    Interact
    with the map to explore the history of Washington Inner City Self Help (WISH),
    the housing cooperatives Linda Leaks helped establish, and the communities that
    shaped Black homeplaces across Washington, D.C.'
