  m_text: '<b>Big Mama''s Garden: Rest in Peace</b>


    Meshell Sturgis


    <i>Interactive
    Memorial</i>


    View a memorial honoring Zena "Big Mama" Sturgis through a
    garden created as a space of remembrance, love, and reflection. Open the memorial
    to explore the photograph and its tribute, preserving the memory of home, family,
    and those whose presence continues to shape the places we call home.'
